{
  "name": "loomwright",
  "version": "15.94.0",
  "description": "Loomwright is a plan-first, multi-agent development system for Claude Code. Launch Pad turns a goal into a reviewed brief; Supervisor executes it autonomously across parallel git worktrees with self-heal; dedicated agents cover code review, red-teaming, QA, and standalone PR review-and-heal. 14 agent roles, 24 slash commands, 42 skills, 43 quality gate hooks. Full history in CHANGELOG.md.",
